'' with two parameters (7, and the definition on 19), 191 for a setter with none or three (8, 9),
'' 213 for STATIC (10). tiko lifts the one-index limit and allows a static property
'' (docs/tiko-properties R13, R11): 7, 9 and 10 are accepted, 8 still has no value, and 19
'' matches no declaration of g1 (TKO0796).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/property-shape.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: property-shape.bas(8,13): error TKO0787: a property setter takes its value, after any indices
'' EXPECT-OUT: property-shape.bas(19,1): error TKO0796
